               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>Multiplicación por: <input class=\"ordercheck\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"1\" /> Unidades <input class=\"ordercheck\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"2\" /> Decenas</center></p><p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmtc1\">7</span> <br />× &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmbc2\">1</span><span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmbc1\">3</span><br />_________<br /></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmptrc2\">2</span><span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmptrc1\">1</span><br />+&nbsp;&nbsp; <span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmpbrc2\">7</span><span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmpbrc1\">0</span><br />_________<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmrc2\">9</span><span class=\"multexample1\" id=\"mmrc1\">1 </span></center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 5</b>: Multiplicación de 7 por 13.</p>",
