               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp; <span class=\"multexample\" id=\"mmoc6\">2</span><span class=\"multexample\" id=\"mmoc5\">&nbsp;</span> <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; <span class=\"multexample\" id=\"mmtc6\">1</span><span class=\"multexample\" id=\"mmtc5\">3</span> <br />× &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"multexample\" id=\"mmbc5\">7 </span><br />_____<br /></span>&nbsp; <span class=\"multexample\" id=\"mmrc6\">9</span><span class=\"multexample\" id=\"mmrc5\">1 </span></center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 6</b>: Multiplicación de 13 por 7.</p>",
